2. Read findings + timeline bodies from disk: `os.ReadFile(manifest.FindingsDoc)` and `os.ReadFile(manifest.TimelineDoc)`. Use `deps.ReadFile` if non-nil for test injection. Tolerate missing files (warn but proceed with whatever is available — at least one of the docs should exist).
