   Run ID: <run-id>

   ## Investigation findings

   <findings doc body>

   ## Investigation timeline

   <timeline doc body>
   ```
4. Print a one-line banner to `in.Out`: `"Launching <fix-agent> with findings from run <run-id> ..."`.
